{"articleNo":"2641","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2641&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010-2학기 대학원별 학위논문심사 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.10.22","hit":"12127","attachments":[{"name":"대학원별 교과이수요건 및 학차별 학위수여 요건 이행사항.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2641&attachNo=2393"},{"name":"신청서 및 추천서(양식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2641&attachNo=2689"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2010-2학기 대학원(일반, 산업 및 교육)<br>학위논문심사 신청&nbsp;안내<br><br></span></p><hr><p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1. 제출대상자 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011. 2월 대학원 졸업예정자 (졸업요건이되는자)<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">박사과정</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 졸업예정자 학위논문 학술지 게재 실적제출 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;￭ 제출논문 조건 :&nbsp;재학 중에 학생명의(공동연구자포함)로 해외저명 학술지에&nbsp;1편 이상 또는 국내 전국 규모 학술지에 2편 이상 게재된 논문</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;￭ 게재된 경우 : 논문 별쇄본 1부 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;￭ 게재 예정인 경우 : 게재(예정)증명서 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(게재예정일자가 논문심사완료일(10.12.17)이전 일것</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 제출기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2010. 10. 25(월) ~ 10. 28(목)&nbsp; // 09:00 ~ 20:00</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 제출장소 : 대학원지원팀 (글로벌관 412호)</span> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. 논문심사료 납부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 납부기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2010. 10. 25(월) ~ 10. 28(목) // 09:00 ~ 20:00 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 논문심사료 : 박사과정 300,000원, 석사과정 100,000원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 납부장소 : 대학원지원팀 (글로벌관 412호) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 논문심사 신청서 제출</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 제출기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2010. 10. 25(월) ~ 10. 28(목)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 제출서류 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 논문심사신청서 1부 (첨부파일 다운로드)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;② 지도교수추천서 1부 (첨부파일 다운로드)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;③ 심사용 논문(석사 : 3부, 박사 : 5부) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;④ 논문심사료 납입영수증(사본 제출) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">다. 제출장소 : 각 학과(전공) 종합학사행정실 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">5</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">학위논문 심사기간 (학과별)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> : 2010.11.18(목) ~ 12.17(금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◦ 논문발표 등 학과별 심사일정은 학과별 기준에 따름 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">6.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">학위논문 완성본 제출 (제출양식 등 세부사항은 추후 공고) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◦ 완성논문 제출기간 : 2010.01.12(수) ~ 01.14(금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2010.&nbsp; 10.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">대학원(일반, 산업 및 교육대학원)장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
